# Copy to `.env` when the project introduces environment-based configuration.
# `.env` is gitignored; this file is committed and must never contain secrets.
#
# Add a variable here in the same change that makes the application read it.
# Document whether it is required, its accepted values, and a safe local default.
# Do not pre-populate fictional database URLs or API keys: an example file that
# drifts from the application is worse than an intentionally empty one.
